{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CfvahaTwF7ZSLkRGq3h7r","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Recommendation: reshape. Don't approve the six-week study as proposed, and don't refuse.**\n\n**Why not as proposed.** Six weeks of an engineer is a real cost. It's being spent on a requirement no other customer has asked for, from a counterparty who won't commit to volume or timeline. After four months, the bank has added a requirement and committed to nothing in return. A feasibility study also tends to turn into a build commitment, because the bank will treat \"we studied it\" as \"we're doing it.\"\n\n**Why not refuse.** A large bank logo may be strategically valuable. Banks often use \"on-premise\" loosely, so the legal requirement may be satisfiable more cheaply than it sounds.\n\n**Bounded next step:**\n1. **Clarify the requirement first (about a week, sales and legal).** Find out what the bank means by on-premise. It could be single-tenant cloud, their own VPC or private cloud (bring-your-own-cloud), or a true data-center install. Also find out whether this is a hard legal line or an opening position.\n2. **Ask for a commitment in return.** Get a named business sponsor, a rough volume and timeline, and ideally a paid pilot or LOI that covers the on-premise work.\n3. **Cap the engineering at 3–5 days.** One engineer and an architect do a desk review: the main blockers, a rough cost range, and which cheaper deployment options might satisfy the bank. No prototype.\n4. **Set kill criteria in advance.** If the bank needs a true data-center install and won't commit, park it.\n\n**The decision to put to the sales lead:** are we willing to build an on-premise product for one uncommitted prospect? If not, the study only delays that answer."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3449,"cache_read_input_tokens":5000,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3449},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ef9e6452-763e-41db-a72c-730069195b4d","uuid":"8650c585-a2ad-4ddd-a29a-e238f002f6ea","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:08:58.126Z","request_id":"req_011CfvahaDoZ9BT9mZzDukEg"}
